# Pharmacy SPA (.NET 10 + Angular 22) Guidelines

## Architecture & Code Rules
- Backend: .NET 10 Web API, C# 12 features (primary constructors, record types).
- Storage: Persistent JSON files (`medicines.json`, `sales.json`) using thread-safe `SemaphoreSlim` async locks. NEVER use in-memory arrays without disk sync.
- Frontend: Angular 22 Standalone Components, Zoneless Change Detection, Signals (`signal`, `computed`), and Native Control Flow (`@for`, `@if`).
- Form State: Use Angular Signal Forms / Modern Reactive Forms. Do NOT use legacy template-driven forms.
- Coding Style: Strict typing, explicit return types, no `any`, and zero warnings on build.
- UI Indicators: Expiry < 30 days (`#f8d7da`), Quantity < 10 (`#fff3cd`), Combined edge-case (`#f7c697`).
